{% comment %}
  首页的航迹云（Contrail）摘要。数据来自独立仓库 Functionhx/contrail 发布的静态 JSON，
  只在卡片接近视口时才加载；读不到数据时保留占位符和详情链接，不影响首页其它部分。
{% endcomment %}
{% assign contrail_url = 'https://functionhx.github.io/contrail/' %}
<section class="function-contrail" aria-labelledby="contrail-heading" data-contrail-card data-contrail-base="{{ contrail_url }}">
  <div class="function-contrail-heading">
    <h2 id="contrail-heading"><span class="function-contrail-total" data-contrail-field="total">—</span>AI 编程用量</h2>
    <p class="function-contrail-lede">航迹云：Claude Code、Codex、OpenCode 的累计 token（含缓存），每天自动更新。</p>
    <a class="function-contrail-link" href="{{ contrail_url }}">查看详情 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="function-contrail-body">
    <dl class="function-contrail-stats">
      <div>
        <dt>近 7 天 token</dt>
        <dd data-contrail-field="week-tokens">—</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>近 7 天估算花费</dt>
        <dd data-contrail-field="week-cost">—</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>累计估算花费</dt>
        <dd data-contrail-field="total-cost">—</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>活跃天数</dt>
        <dd data-contrail-field="active-days">—</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <div class="function-contrail-chart" data-contrail-chart aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="function-contrail-meta" data-contrail-field="meta" role="status">近 30 天每日 token</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/contrail-card.js' | relative_url | bust_file_cache }}" defer></script>
